### Registrer en ny bruger (Happy Path)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "SKRIV EN GYLDIG EMAIL HER",
  "password": "SKRIV ET PASSWORD HER"
}

### Login med ny bruger (Happy Path)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "email": "{{admin_email}}",
 "password": "{{admin_password}}"
}


